WEBVTT

00:08:59.994 --> 00:09:01.495
Now, still, I thought,

00:09:01.537 --> 00:09:05.124
if the budget doesn't celebrate
the historicness of the show,

00:09:05.165 --> 00:09:06.458
then the creative can.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.336
I can bring some much needed
spice to late-night.

00:09:09.795 --> 00:09:11.463
And sometimes I was successful.

00:09:12.256 --> 00:09:13.549
But other times,

00:09:13.591 --> 00:09:15.884
I would receive notes like,

00:09:15.884 --> 00:09:17.219
"Don't be so loud."

00:09:17.261 --> 00:09:18.596
"Don't be so big."

00:09:18.637 --> 00:09:20.723
"Don't be so angry, smile more."

00:09:20.723 --> 00:09:22.808
And my all time favorite,

00:09:22.808 --> 00:09:25.477
"Don't overindex
on the South Asian stuff."

00:09:27.479 --> 00:09:31.358
After all, everyone else at the table
who's been sitting there for years,